SUMMARY:Lisa Henson in Conversation
DESCRIPTION:Join Lisa Henson\, CEO of The Jim Henson Company for a rare and
  intimate conversation reflecting on 70 years of the company’s creativit
 y and innovation. Discover the stories behind some of the most cherished c
 haracters in screen history and hear firsthand how The Jim Henson Company 
 continues to push the boundaries of puppetry\, animatronics and digital an
 imation to reinvent storytelling for every generation. In conversation wit
 h writer and broadcaster Benjamin Law. This event is sold out. Sign up to 
 join the waitlist to be notified when a spot becomes available.
LOCATION:GOMA\, Stanley Place\, South Bank
URL:https://www.qagoma.qld.gov.au/event/lisahensonconversation-2026-09-12
END:VEVENT
