DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260101
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260102
SUMMARY:groundwork: 50 years of art\, artists\, education and community
DESCRIPTION:Our 2026 program groundwork honours five decades of art\, artis
 ts\, education and community at UQ Art Museum.
LOCATION:UQ Art Museum\, William St
