SUMMARY:Truth Seekers – Bring Your Own Conspiracy Night
DESCRIPTION:Welcome to the first annual Truth Seekers\, Meanjin (Brisbane)\
 , Australia. Truth Seekers is the premier gathering of free thinkers\, tru
 th seekers\, and true believers. This is a Bring Your Own conspiracy event
  - if you have a theory that is yearning for the light of day\, this is yo
 ur opportunity to get on stage and speak your truth. This year we open the
  floor to the Brisbane community of the conspiritorially minded. We invite
  you to bring your lecture\, workshop\, discussion\, performace\, etc to t
 he conference. Enlighten your fellow Truth Seekers between talks. Bring yo
 ur dossier of truth\, chemtrail charts\, alien detection devices\, and lis
 tening bugs. You never know when you might meet your next big client! We w
 ill be taking submissions for preparing a schedule so if you have somethin
 g you’ve prepared let us know what you need and a rough idea of the topi
 c and format so we can allocate a space. The entrance and ground floor of 
 the venue is wheelchair accessible and accessible bathrooms are on the rig
 ht hand side at the entrance of the ground floor. This is an 18+ event. Mi
 nors must be accompanied by a parent or guardian. A range of alcoholic and
  non-alcoholic beverages are available and the kitchen is serving a range 
 of pizzas and other hot foods with vegan\, vegetarian and gluten free opti
 ons. This event is taking place on the lands of the Yuggera and Turrbal pe
 oples. Sovreignty was never ceded. [button link="https://events.humanitix.
 com/truth-seekers-byo-conspiracy-night"]Tickets[/button]
LOCATION:The Cave Inn\, 47 Balaclava St.\, Woolloongabba\, QLD\, 4102
URL:https://thecaveinn.net/events/truth-seekers-bring-your-own-conspiracy-n
 ight/
END:VEVENT
